# Allowlist: nothing goes into the build context unless it is listed here, so secrets (.env), tests, caches
# and anything new in the repo stay out of images by default. Later lines win over earlier ones.
*

# The workspace and its lockfile; the READMEs and LICENSE are read when the packages are built.
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Each package's metadata and code (not its tests).
!packages/*/pyproject.toml
!packages/*/README.md
!packages/*/src/
!workflows/pyproject.toml
!workflows/README.md
!workflows/src/

# Re-excluded even inside the folders above: env files (secrets) and bytecode from local runs.
**/.env*
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
